   "id": "_LNr6NOJCAAJ",
   "from": "Alexander Bertram",
   "author": "f06db63329fab1f9",
   "date": "2017-10-03T09:33:33Z",
   "subject": "Re: srand was found at compile-time",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Changxin,<div><br></div><div>It looks like the C code in the e1071 package makes a call to the C standard library function &quot;srand&quot; [1], which was not implemented in Renjin&#39;s C library [2].</div><div><br></div><div>Normally, packages are supposed to generate random numbers through R&#39;s API, but I guess some packages can include a stray reference here and there to the C standard library&#39;s routines, so I&#39;ve added wrappers around Java&#39;s Random class [3]. Perhaps we should automatically transform calls to srand() and rand() to calls into the R session&#39;s random number generator? I&#39;m not sure how this will affect the behavior so I&#39;ve left it simple for now.</div><div><br></div><div>A new build of e1071 1.5-22 is now available with this fix [4].</div><div><br></div><div>You might also consider using the latest version of e1071, as it is (again) compatible with Renjin after another fix today.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Alex</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>[1] <a href=\"http://www.cplusplus.com/reference/cstdlib/srand/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.cplusplus.com/reference/cstdlib/srand/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343491262000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1SQpJFQow5dmeToKpGtUME\">http://www.cplusplus.com/reference/cstdlib/srand/</a></div><div>[2] <a href=\"https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/blob/master/tools/gcc-bridge/runtime/src/main/java/org/renjin/gcc/runtime/Stdlib.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/blob/master/tools/gcc-bridge/runtime/src/main/java/org/renjin/gcc/runtime/Stdlib.java&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343491262000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1rxy7xjX771LMNjQ0N4PQj\">https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/blob/master/tools/gcc-bridge/runtime/src/main/java/org/renjin/gcc/runtime/Stdlib.java</a></div><div>[3] <a href=\"https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/commit/e43999813392f694dc3f983a18ffd177cf1ba089\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/commit/e43999813392f694dc3f983a18ffd177cf1ba089&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343491262000&amp;usg=AOvVaw36kpZyhZtIs4H4Zw9lmbbE\">https://github.com/bedatadriven/renjin/commit/e43999813392f694dc3f983a18ffd177cf1ba089</a></div><div>[4] <a href=\"http://packages.renjin.org/package/org.renjin.cran/e1071/1.5-22\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://packages.renjin.org/package/org.renjin.cran/e1071/1.5-22&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793343491262000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0-eNJbbk0Tx_4Ee9DvxETQ\">http://packages.renjin.org/package/org.renjin.cran/e1071/1.5-22</a></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
